@page "/components/embed"

<PageOutlet Url="components/embed"
            Title="Embed"
            Description="BitEmbed frames a video, a map or another site in an iframe at an aspect ratio that scales with its container, with an optional click-to-load placeholder." />

<DemoPage Name="Embed"
          SecondaryNames="@(["Iframe", "VideoEmbed", "ResponsiveEmbed"])"
          Description="BitEmbed frames embedded content - a YouTube video, a map, a page of another site - in an iframe kept at an aspect ratio that scales with its container, so it shrinks on a phone instead of keeping the fixed size an iframe has of its own. It is lazy by default, and a PlaceholderTemplate turns it into a click-to-load facade that loads no iframe until the user asks for it - what the placeholder shows itself, such as a remote thumbnail, still loads before that."
          Parameters="componentParameters"
          SubClasses="componentSubClasses"
          SubEnums="componentSubEnums"
          CssVariables="componentCssVariables"
          GitHubUrl="Utilities/Embed/BitEmbed.razor"
          GitHubDemoUrl="Utilities/Embed/BitEmbedDemo.razor">
    <NotesTemplate>
        <BitText>
            An iframe needs a Title to be accessible - it is how a screen reader names the embedded content - so the
            compiler warns about a BitEmbed written without one. Only an http or https Src, or a relative one, is rendered:
            any other scheme (javascript:, data:, ...) is refused and the frame is left empty.
        </BitText>
    </NotesTemplate>
    <Examples>
        <DemoExample Title="Basic" RazorCode="@example1RazorCode" Id="example1">
            <div>
                Src is the address of the content and Title what a screen reader calls it. The frame takes the width of its
                container and keeps the 16 / 9 shape of a video at any width - resize the window to see it scale.
            </div>
            <br />
            <div>
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc"
                          Title="bit Boilerplate features overview" />
            </div>
        </DemoExample>

        <DemoExample Title="AspectRatio & MaxWidth" RazorCode="@example2RazorCode" Id="example2">
            <div>
                AspectRatio gives the frame another shape, as a CSS aspect-ratio value, and MaxWidth caps its width; below it
                the frame still shrinks with its container.
            </div>
            <br />
            <div>
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc"
                          Title="bit Boilerplate features overview"
                          MaxWidth="560px" />
                <br />
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-0.1357%2C51.4985%2C-0.1157%2C51.5085"
                          Title="A map of central London"
                          AspectRatio="4 / 3"
                          MaxWidth="400px" />
            </div>
        </DemoExample>

        <DemoExample Title="Iframe attributes" RazorCode="@example3RazorCode" Id="example3">
            <div>
                Allow, AllowFullScreen, ReferrerPolicy and Sandbox are the iframe attributes of the same names, and Loading
                is lazy unless it is set to Eager - for an embed on the first screen of a page.
            </div>
            <br />
            <div>
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc"
                          Title="bit Boilerplate features overview"
                          Allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                          AllowFullScreen
                          Loading="BitImageLoading.Eager"
                          ReferrerPolicy="BitImageReferrerPolicy.StrictOriginWhenCrossOrigin"
                          MaxWidth="560px" />
                <br />
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-0.1357%2C51.4985%2C-0.1157%2C51.5085"
                          Title="A map of central London"
                          Sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin"
                          AspectRatio="4 / 3"
                          MaxWidth="400px" />
            </div>
        </DemoExample>

        <DemoExample Title="Click to load" RazorCode="@example4RazorCode" Id="example4">
            <div>
                With a PlaceholderTemplate the iframe is not rendered - and none of the embedded page is requested - until
                the user clicks the placeholder or activates it with the keyboard; then the iframe takes its place and its
                focus. What the placeholder shows loads as it renders, so the remote thumbnail below is requested up front;
                keep it on your own server to send nothing to another site before the click. The placeholder is a button
                named "Load" followed by the Title, or by PlaceholderAriaLabel.
            </div>
            <br />
            <div>
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc?autoplay=1"
                          Title="bit Boilerplate features overview"
                          Allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
                          AllowFullScreen
                          MaxWidth="560px"
                          PlaceholderAriaLabel="Play the bit Boilerplate features overview">
                    <PlaceholderTemplate>
                        <img class="thumbnail" src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/79ssLqSInxc/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" />
                        <span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="currentColor" /></svg>
                        </span>
                    </PlaceholderTemplate>
                </BitEmbed>
            </div>
        </DemoExample>

        <DemoExample Title="Style & Class" RazorCode="@example5RazorCode" Id="example5">
            <div>
                Classes and Styles reach the root (the frame), the placeholder and the iframe, and the --bit-Embed-*
                variables restyle the defaults.
            </div>
            <br />
            <div>
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc"
                          Title="bit Boilerplate features overview"
                          MaxWidth="400px"
                          Style="--bit-Embed-radius: 1rem;" />
                <br />
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc"
                          Title="bit Boilerplate features overview"
                          MaxWidth="400px"
                          Classes="@(new() { Root = "custom-root" })" />
                <br />
                <BitEmbed Src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-0.1357%2C51.4985%2C-0.1157%2C51.5085"
                          Title="A map of central London"
                          AspectRatio="4 / 3"
                          MaxWidth="400px"
                          Styles="@(new() { Root = "border: 2px solid var(--bit-clr-pri);", Frame = "filter: grayscale(1);" })" />
            </div>
        </DemoExample>
        <DemoExample Title="RTL" RazorCode="@example6RazorCode" Id="example6">
            <div>
                The embedded page keeps its own direction; Dir changes the flow of the frame and of the placeholder drawn in it.
            </div>
            <br />
            <div dir="rtl">
                <BitEmbed Dir="BitDir.Rtl"
                          Src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/79ssLqSInxc?autoplay=1"
                          Title="معرفی امکانات bit Boilerplate"
                          Allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
                          AllowFullScreen
                          MaxWidth="560px"
                          PlaceholderAriaLabel="پخش ویدیوی معرفی امکانات bit Boilerplate">
                    <PlaceholderTemplate>
                        <img class="thumbnail" src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/79ssLqSInxc/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" />
                        <span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="currentColor" /></svg>
                        </span>
                        <span class="caption">معرفی امکانات bit Boilerplate</span>
                    </PlaceholderTemplate>
                </BitEmbed>
            </div>
        </DemoExample>
    </Examples>
</DemoPage>
